<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus suspended news pending-SBF.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus suspended news pending-SBF.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Canal Plus were suspended on Friday pending the release of a communique, French stock markets authority SBF said on Friday.</p>
<p>The SBF said the suspension would last all day Friday.</p>
</text>
